 valign=top style='width:210.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.35pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>MAGNESIUM <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=146 valign=top style='width:109.45pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.35pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>PHOTOMETRY<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.35pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:18.6pt'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>2.72\r\n  <\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=146 valign=top style='width:109.8pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.35pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>mg\/dL<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:13.35pt'>\r\n  <td width=281 valign=top style='width:210.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.35pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=146 valign=top style='width:109.45pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.35pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.35pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=146 valign=top style='width:109.8pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.35pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>Reference\r\nRange :-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>1.90 - 3.10<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><b><i><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>CLINICAL\r\nSIGNIFICANCE:<\/span><\/i><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><i><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif;color:#222222'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/i><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>Magnesium is the fourth most abundant\r\ncation in the body and second most prevalent&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>Intracellular cation. The total body\r\nmagnesium content is about 25 g or approximately 1 mol, of&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>Which 55% reside in the skeleton.\r\nAbout 45% of the magnesium is intracellular. In general higher&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>The metabolic activity of cell, the\r\ngreater is its magnesium content. Magnesium is a cofactor for&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>More than 300 enzymes in the\r\nbody.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>Disorders of magnesium metabolism are\r\nseparated into those causing hypomagnesaemia\/magnesium&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>Deficiencies and hypermagnesemia.\r\nHypomagnesaemia is common in patient in hospitals. Moderate to&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>Severe deficiency of magnesium is\r\nusually due to loss of magnesium from the gastrointestinal (gi)&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>Tract or kidneys. One of the more\r\nserious complications of magnesium deficiency is cardiac&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>Arrhythmia. Symptomatic hypermagnsemia\r\nis almost always caused by excessive intake, resulting&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>From administration of antacids,\r\nenemas, and parenteral fluids containing magnesium. Depression&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='background:white'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#222222'>Of neuromuscular system is the most\r\ncommon manifestation of magnesium intoxication.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"595.45pt 841.7pt","margin":"151.2pt 36.0pt 72.0pt 36.0pt"}}